    {
      "text": "22-story affordable senior tower. SJ Build: special use permit expires March 28, 2027.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001819"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "CEQAnet description: partial demolition of the Realty Building, a City Landmark, keeping the front facade, exterior walls and part of the interior core; a 22-story building with one basement level, 146,458 gross sq ft, about 18,643 sq ft of commercial space on floors 1 and 2, and 220 affordable senior units on floors 3 through 22. The Special Use Permit would also consider commercial condominiums.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002572"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Realty Building was built in 1925 in Beaux-Arts style, designed by Wolfe and Higgens. San Jose Spotlight reported that Angelou's Mexican Grill, a tenant since 2006, would need to relocate.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002573",
        "SRC-002571"
      ]
    },
    {
